added.notes:
This dataset contains 3-D currents, water temperature, conductivity, and others from a single heavily instrumented sub surface mooring operated for the Dynamics of the Oakney Passage Outflow (DYNOPO) Program.  Instrumentation consists of:

moored current meter estimates of east velocity, north velocity, vertical velocity and time;
moored SBE-37 CTD data;
moored SBE-39 temperature recorder data;
moored RBR solo-T temperature recorder data.

Data are in NetCDF.
